Theorem inbox_file_read_failure : forall path,
  inbox_file_plan path None = [InboxQueue path "", InboxRemove path].
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.

Theorem inbox_file_read_success : forall path content,
  inbox_file_plan path (Some content) = [InboxQueue path content, InboxRemove path].
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.

Theorem inbox_empty_listing : forall directory, inbox_paths directory [] = [].
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.

Example inbox_suffix_and_order :
  inbox_json_name ".json" = true /\
  inbox_json_name "x.JSON" = false /\
  inbox_paths "/inbox" ["z.json", "skip", "a.json"] = ["/inbox/z.json", "/inbox/a.json"].
Proof. repeat split; reflexivity. Qed.
